        "subject": "LU-20578 tests: drop unused check_parameter argument",
        "message": "LU-20578 tests: drop unused check_parameter argument\n\nNo caller of check_parameter() passes a third argument, so the\nexpected NI count always came from the default. Take it from the\nnet-scoped query directly and drop the parameter.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet env=ONLY=\"241 310\"\nFixes: f4d87c1385ca (\"LU-20578 tests: count configured NIs in check_parameter\")\nSigned-off-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I4174ddeec0f28e3d69416cc4df6a4a3bf54f721b\n"
